# Messages of the errors owned by arc-base. Identifiers are registered in
# crates/arc-base/src/error.rs.

base-id-invalid = The text is not a valid identifier.
base-unit-dimension-mismatch = The quantities measure different things and cannot be combined.
base-unit-unknown = The unit { $name } is not known.
base-display-invalid-increment = The rounding increment must be a positive number.
base-cancelled = The operation was cancelled.
base-display-notation-mismatch = This notation does not apply to the quantity's dimension.
base-display-invalid-notation = The denominator or the number of decimals is not supported.
base-display-value-out-of-range = The value is not finite or is too large for this notation.
base-display-parse-invalid = The text is not a value in this notation.
